OL,3,GNEWSANo date for long-delayed #40m
OL,4,A'ghost junction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #40m motorway "ghost junction" which
OL,7,Fhas been left unused since 2020 still
OL,8,Fhas no confirmed opening date, a
OL,9,Fgovernment minister has said.
OL,11,FThe junction above the M49 motorway
OL,12,Fnear Bristol now faces extensive
OL,13,Frepairs despite never being used by a
OL,14,Fsingle vehicle due to defects found
OL,15,Flittle more than a year after it was
OL,16,Ffinished.
OL,18,FIn a House of Commons debate Claire
OL,19,FYoung, MP for Thornbury and Yate asked
OL,20,Froads minister Justin Madders if he was
OL,21,Fas "baffled" as she was by the
OL,22,Fsituation.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
