OL,3,GNEWSANo date for long-delayed #40m
OL,4,A'ghost junction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMadders said the government had already
OL,7,Fprovided around #10m of support for the
OL,8,Fjunction's development and said it was
OL,9,Fnot possible to provide a "definitive
OL,10,Ftimeline" for its opening.
